Subject: [EXPERIMENT] ASoC: AudioReach: encode FullIO container parent and heap

Adapt the variable-sized graph-open container records from the pinned
Golden v32 reference. Legacy containers retain the original wire layout.
This does not enable the FullIO graph or transmit calibration.

